  <trk>
    <name>TET-UK-Borderlands-20210815</name>
    <desc>Hogwarts, Romans and Vikings
- best ridden anticlockwise with a gentle intro to the UK from the port before getting tougher as it hits the Scottish border and heads south
- about 30% unsealed roads
- best with 2 or more riders to deal with the gates…….
- aimed a middle weight trail bikes. T7 and CRF Rally - perfect, Enduros - sore bums and some tedium, GS’s - have fun in the fords</desc>
    <extensions>
      <gpxx:TrackExtension>
        <gpxx:DisplayColor>Red</gpxx:DisplayColor>
      </gpxx:TrackExtension>
    </extensions>
